ural gas distribution activities in Quebec. The Renewable Power Generation segment operates wind, solar, geothermal, waste heat recovery, and transmission assets in North America. The company was formerly known as IPL Energy Inc. and changed its name to Enbridge Inc. in October 1998. Enbridge Inc. was founded in 1949 and is headquartered in Calgary, Canada.","fullTimeEmployees":14800,"city":"Calgary","country":"Canada","website":"https://www.enbridge.com","industry":"Oil & Gas Midstream","sector":"Energy"},"news":[{"title":"Market Chatter: Enbridge's Woodfibre LNG Project to Receive $140 Million From Canadian Government","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/energy/articles/market-chatter-enbridge-apos-woodfibre-121312211.html","publisher":"MT Newswires","date":"2026-11-13"},{"title":"A $15 Billion Fund Just Bought These 3 Stocks","link":"https://www.tikr.com/blog/15-billion-fund-bought-3-stocks-meta-nisource-enbridge?ref=yahoofinance&tlnk=yf-261113-gjrpc542","publisher":"TIKR","date":"2026-11-13"},{"title":"Can Williams Afford Its Spending Bill?","link":"https://www.trefis.com/stock/wmb/articles/624695/can-williams-afford-its-spending-bill/2026-11-12","publisher":"Trefis","date":"2026-11-12"},{"title":"Enbridge Inc (ENB) Is a Trending Stock: Facts to Know Before Betting on It","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/enbridge-inc-enb-trending-stock-130003276.html","publisher":"Zacks","date":"2026-11-12"},{"title":"How Strong Quarterly Results Will Impact Enbridge (TSX:ENB) Investors","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/strong-quarterly-results-impact-enbridge-021437452.html","publisher":"Simply Wall St.","date":"2026-11-11"},{"title":"Enbridge vs. Occidental Petroleum: Does a Midstream or Upstream Energy Focus Make for a Better Stock Buy for 2027?","link":"https://www.fool.com/coverage/better-buy/2026/11/10/enbridge-vs-occidental-petroleum-does-a-midstream-or-upstream-energy-focus-make-for-a-better-stock-buy-for-2027/","publisher"